            "review_title": "Review at Huong Cau 2 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "EndaTravel\nSilver Spring, Maryland365 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese Dishes For Large Groups\nOct 2016 • Business\nThis restaurant is huge and even has a private dining space on the fifth floor. We were invited to a company dinner party on the fifth floor and it was amazing. The private dining space had space for 100 people, white linens, white chair covers, a stage and beautiful large windows.\n\nThe food was really good and plentiful! We enjoyed grilled squid, hot pot with prawns and fish balls, fried rice, fried calamari, duck, beef with lemongrass and finished the meal with rau cau. The staff were also phenomenal. They were able to feed every table almost exactly at the same time with precision. \n\nWe walked away impressed with the level of service and the quality of food for such a reasonable price. I highly recommend for large groups or large business meetings.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 28, 2016",
